<ContentLayout title="Patch Library" description="Community patches, compatibility notes, and tooling—with original firmware kept out of distribution." eyebrow="Distribution policy // deltas only" status="confirmed"><section class="section-block notice"><h2>No copyrighted firmware images</h2><p>TamaMedics does not host or distribute copyrighted Bandai firmware. Releases should contain patches or transformation tools—BPS, xdelta, IPS where appropriate, scripts, checksums, and documentation—not original firmware.</p></section><section class="section-block panel panel-pad"><h2>Before applying a patch</h2><ul class="plain-list"><li>Verify the exact device model and hardware revision.</li><li>Verify the firmware revision and required checksum or hash.</li><li>Retain a verified backup of your original dump.</li><li>Never write an unverified image to hardware.</li></ul></section><section class="section-block"><h2>Release index</h2><p>No public patch releases are listed yet. Compatibility data and independently reproducible tooling will accompany future entries.</p></section></ContentLayout>
